From: BlackF1re <55582873+BlackF1re@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: iio: sx9500: describe power supplies

Describe the main and host-interface supplies, using the vdd/svdd names
shared by other Semtech capacitive proximity bindings.

Signed-off-by: BlackF1re <55582873+BlackF1re@users.noreply.github.com>
---
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/proximity/semtech,sx9500.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/proximity/semtech,sx9500.yaml
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/proximity/semtech,sx9500.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iio/proximity/semtech,sx9500.yaml
@@ -18,6 +18,12 @@
 
   interrupts:
     maxItems: 1
+
+  vdd-supply:
+    description: Main power supply
+
+  svdd-supply:
+    description: Host interface power supply
 
   reset-gpios:
     description:
